// Clue Name :
"P1624530170" "Return of the S'lisur"
// DetailString :
"P1122646230" "When investigating a problem with new mutant Snakes on Mercy Island, you heard one of them mention the return of the S'lisur and Stheno."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3505267552" "Ancient History"
// DetailString :
"P519901039" "It all started when Operative Grillo was called by Kalinda on Mercy Island about some Snake problems occurring there. Grillo sent you to speak with Mongoose, who told you about a new breed of Snake he had run into which was vastly more powerful than anything he had encountered before. You checked out the Snake pit he mentioned and found a nest of powerful Snakes who spoke of the return of Stheno and rise of the S'lisur. Operative Grillo mentioned how Arachnos came to the Rogue Isles and first encountered the Snakes, driving them deep underground."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1906697456" "It all started when Operative Grillo was called by Kalinda on Mercy Island about some Snake problems occurring there. Grillo sent you to speak with Mongoose, who told you about a new breed of Snake he had run into which was vastly more powerful than anything he had encountered before. You checked out the Snake pit he mentioned and found a nest of powerful Snakes who spoke of the return of Stheno and rise of the S'lisur. Operative Grillo mentioned how Arachnos came to the Rogue Isles and first encountered the Snakes, driving them deep underground.<br><br>Operative Grillo wanted you to know more about the history of the Snakes, and so sent you to speak with Regent Korol. Korol told you a story about how the Snakes ruled over the Rogue Isles and how the early settlers paid homage to them. The Snakes unlocked the secrets of the earth and the world trembled at the touch of Stheno."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LoreOfTheSsilur 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2196289910" "The Lore of the S'lisur"
// DetailString :
"P46928022" "You invaded a Circle temple in the Nerva Archipelago and found the Lore of the S'lisur, revealing how in ancient times a pregnant woman drank from the Well of Furies and was transformed by it. She became known as the Gorgon Stheno, sister of Medusa. Stheno fled across the ocean in search of a place where she could give birth to her progeny and came to the islands where the Rogue Islands now exist. The birth of her progeny exhausted her, and so she retreated underground to rest and recover for centuries."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL9_Grillo_Mini_Arc_1_Souvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P14313625" "Snake Talisman"
// tDetailString :
"P2189585535" "This is an ancient Snake Talisman. You received it from one of the powerful Snakes in a tale you like to call:<br><br><b>Ancient History</b><br><br>It all started when Operative Grillo was called by Kalinda on Mercy Island about some Snake problems occurring there. Grillo sent you to speak with Mongoose, who told you about a new breed of Snake he ran into which was vastly more powerful than anything he had encountered before. You checked out the Snake pit he mentioned and found a nest of powerful Snakes who spoke of the return of Stheno and rise of the S'lisur. Operative Grillo mentioned how Arachnos came to the Rogue Isles and first encountered the Snakes, driving them deep underground.<br><br>Operative Grillo wanted you to know more about the history of the Snakes, and so sent you to speak with Regent Korol. Korol told you a story about how the Snakes ruled over the Rogue Isles and how the early settlers paid homage to them. The Snakes unlocked the secrets of the earth and the  world trembled at the touch of Stheno.<br><br>Operative Grillo spoke with the Arachnos Mystics and they mentioned how the Circle of Thorns may be keeping information on the Snakes as well. You invaded a Circle temple in the Nerva Archipelago and found the Lore of the S'lisur, revealing how in ancient times a pregnant woman drank from the Well of Furies and was transformed by it. She became known as the Gorgon Stheno, sister of Medusa. Stheno fled across the ocean in search of a place where she could give birth to her progeny and came to the islands where the Rogue Islands now exist. The birth of her progeny exhausted her, and so she retreated underground to rest and recover for centuries. Operative Grillo told you this information would be useful in times to come."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2156676505" "I've received a rather odd request which has filtered up all the way from Kalinda on Mercy Island. Apparently, a fellow by the name of Mongoose has been having troubles with the Snakes infesting the area. I know this seems beneath you, but from his report it sounds like we might actually need someone of your caliber. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Mercy Island and speak with Mongoose.  Take care of whatever problem he's been having with these Snakes!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4176991694" "Time to cull the Snakes again"
// SendOffString :
"P3910490184" "I'm suspecting these Snakes are different from the ones you may have faced before."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2745892209" "Speak with Mongoose"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2735471918" "Please, deal with this problem and speak with me when you're done. We have more things to deal with here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1560729539" "Yo, {VillainName}. I remember when you was just a young punk runnin' through Mercy. Man, you're REAL bad now, eh? Well, this might be just what you need to prove that!<br><br>I seen some Snakes runnin' around some of the pits here on Mercy which ain't like nothin' I seen before. I'm talkin' about big, mean, and nasty. I thought I'd take 'em for a new pair of boots, but then they start whuppin' me hard! I mean, they was fast and killer, and I had to beat tracks before I ended up as Snake chow. I reported it to Kalinda and she said she'd talk to someone higher up in Arachnos. Guess that's why you're here now.<br><br>I seen 'em at this Snake hole.  Deal with 'em if you can, and be quick about it. Last thing we need is some mutant Snakes chowin' down on all the fresh Zig rejects!"

