// Dialog :
"P2813794142" "Steno and the S'lisur? This could be... problematic. Perhaps it is time to enlighten you to some ancient history. When Arachnos first came to the Rogue Isles, they encountered these creatures being worshipped like gods. Arachnos drove them underground, but then looked into a bit more of their past. A few Arachnos operatives keep knowledge of these records, but perhaps this is something worth looking into again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3056697594" "Your recent encounter with the mutant Snakes on Mercy Island has uncovered some history which I thought was buried. I already told you of how the forces of Arachnos first encountered these creatures upon arriving on the Rogue Isles. Well there's more to it than that, and knowledge is the greatest tool to use against our enemies! While I'm not keen on her methods, she has produced results and is fluent in such lore. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Speak with Regent Korol about the Snakes.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1976801422" "Speak with Regent Korol"
// SendOffString :
"P2779368266" "Regent Korol is a center of information for Arachnos, and this makes her valuable."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2040510200" "Speak with Regent Korol, then return to me. We have other tasks to take care of."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1166458637" "Ah, {VillainName}! How are you doing, my pet? I've been watching your progress through Grandville, and the experience has proved most entertaining!<br><br>You wish to know more about the Snakes, yes? I know of these creatures, of how they were once the dominant force of the Rogues Isles, of how early settlers of the islands would refer to them as gods and pay them tributes of blood. These Snakes, or S'lisur as they call themselves worshipped the goddess Stheno. In their great temple beneath the island they unlocked the secrets of the earth. The world trembled at Stheno's touch!<br><br>Recently, I have sensed a stirring at the edge of my consciousness, a powerful psychic force. But when I have reached out for it, it slips away. Whatever it is, it's cunning and ancient. Beware, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1738430624" "Ancient earth gods. Remnants of lost civilizations. This is what we're dealing with here, {VillainName}, and this is what we should be prepared for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P762962321" "There is another source of ancient lore regarding the Snakes which we have not tapped - the Circle of Thorns. I've spoken with the Arachnos Mystics and they have revealed that one of the older Circle temples might have more  information on these Snakes. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Invade the Circle of Thorns temple to find information on the S'lisur!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3295341335" "Steal lore from the Circle"
// SendOffString :
"P4156420187" "The Circle protects their secrets, but this one piece of information shall not remain a secret for long."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3084548429" "This information on the Snakes could prove useful for future endeavors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P507777388" "Find the lore the Circle of Thorns is keeping about the Snakes!"

